OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #12.7m boost for
OL,4,ASEND provision
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford Council is to receive #12.7m
OL,7,Ffrom the government to improve
OL,8,Fprovisions for children with special
OL,9,Feducational needs and disabilities.
OL,11,FThe fund is part of #91m awarded across
OL,12,F14 councils struggling with high-cost
OL,13,Fservices, under the government's Fair
OL,14,FFunding Review.
OL,16,FIn Bradford, the SEND system will see a
OL,17,Fboost in transport places and
OL,18,Feducational psychology support.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
